// MARK: - Shortcuts: eject volume
"Eject Volume" = "推出卷宗";
"Ejects the external disk that holds one volume, chosen by its name. A disk with a protected volume is refused." = "按名称选择一个卷宗，推出包含它的外置磁盘。含有受保护卷宗的磁盘会被拒绝。";
"“%@” ejected." = "已推出“%@”。";
"Could not eject “%@”." = "无法推出“%@”。";
"Could not eject “%@”: %@" = "无法推出“%@”：%@";
"The disk holding “%@” has a protected volume, so it was not ejected." = "包含“%@”的磁盘有受保护的卷宗，因此未推出。";
"“%1$@” was not mounted at “%2$@” because that folder is not empty: mounting there would hide its files until the share is unmounted. Choose an empty folder as the mount point." = "未将“%1$@”挂载到“%2$@”，因为该文件夹不是空的：挂载后其中的文件将被隐藏，直到卸载该共享。请选择一个空文件夹作为挂载点。";

/* Network share export and import */
"Export Shares…" = "导出共享…";
"Import Shares from File…" = "从文件导入共享…";
"Export or Import Shares" = "导出或导入共享";
"Export your saved shares to a file, or import them on another Mac" = "将已保存的共享导出到文件，或在另一台 Mac 上导入";
"Passwords are not exported. They stay in this Mac’s Keychain." = "密码不会被导出，它们仍保存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串中。";
"Could Not Export Shares" = "无法导出共享";
"Could Not Import Shares" = "无法导入共享";
