"This file was exported by a newer version of MountMate. Update MountMate to import it." = "此文件由更新版本的 MountMate 导出。请更新 MountMate 后再导入。";
"Passwords are not exported. Add them by editing each share." = "密码不会被导出。请编辑每个共享以添加密码。";

