"Could Not Mount at Login" = "登录时无法装载";
"MountMate couldn't mount “%1$@” after several tries: %2$@" = "MountMate 多次尝试后仍无法装载“%1$@”：%2$@";
"Unknown error" = "未知错误";

/* Share password rejected */
"Password Rejected" = "密码被拒绝";
"The server rejected the password for “%@”. MountMate stopped reconnecting it so the account doesn't get locked. Update the password in Settings → Network Shares." = "服务器拒绝了“%@”的密码。MountMate 已停止重新连接，以免账户被锁定。请在“设置”→“网络共享”中更新密码。";
"The server rejected the saved password, so MountMate stopped reconnecting this share. Edit the share to enter the new password." = "服务器拒绝了已保存的密码，因此 MountMate 已停止重新连接此共享。请编辑共享并输入新密码。";
"Disks Were Not Mounted Again" = "磁盘未重新装载";

// MARK: - Shortcuts: results and state
"Get Mounted Volumes" = "获取已挂载的卷宗";
"Returns the external volumes that are mounted now, in the order of the MountMate menu." = "按 MountMate 菜单中的顺序返回当前已挂载的外置卷宗。";
"Get Network Shares" = "获取网络共享";
"Returns the network shares saved in MountMate, each with whether it is mounted and its mount point." = "返回 MountMate 中保存的网络共享，以及每个共享是否已挂载和其挂载点。";
"Is Volume Mounted" = "卷宗是否已挂载";
"Tells whether an external volume is mounted now. A volume that is not connected is not mounted." = "判断某个外置卷宗当前是否已挂载。未连接的卷宗视为未挂载。";
