"A volume on this disk is protected. Turn off Protect to eject it." = "此磁盘上有受保护的卷宗。关闭保护后才能推出。";
"Shortcut %@ is off: it needs ⌘ or ⌃. Record a new one in Settings → General → Keyboard Shortcuts." = "快捷键 %@ 已停用：需要 ⌘ 或 ⌃。请在设置 → 通用 → 键盘快捷键中录制新的快捷键。";

